      "sourceText": "在 C++ 内存模型中，数据竞争通常意味着 **未定义行为（undefined behavior）**，并不是简单的“最后结果偶尔少加几次”。编译器可以在未定义行为前提下做出很多看起来反直觉的优化。",
      "translatedText": "In the C++ memory model, a data race usually implies **undefined behavior** , not simply \"the final result occasionally misses a few additions\\.\" The compiler can perform many seemingly counterintuitive optimizations under the premise of undefined behavior\\.",
